[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0010","text":"……好晃眼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0020","text":"阳光很烈啊……\n到重新开拍之前，去阴凉处歇会儿吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0030","text":"是——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0040","text":"──啊，对了\n之前那个颜料的话题……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0050","text":"透你不是说了嘛\n全部混在一起就会变成和服装一样的颜色"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0060","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0070","text":"光呢\n把所有的颜色混在一起会变成白色哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0080","text":"……诶——\n真博学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0090","text":"哈哈，其实那之后我去查了一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000700_03_0100","text":"──呵呵，能变成吗\n我也，变成光"}]
